10:52.020 --> 10:52.720
Nothing moves.

10:52.720 --> 10:53.040
Yes.

10:53.440 --> 10:57.220
And what does a flat gradient look like in the real world?

10:57.740 --> 11:00.940
In cosmology, physicists call it the cosmic heat death.

11:01.260 --> 11:03.040
Just a cold, dark universe.

11:03.400 --> 11:07.220
The universe expands and cools until everything is the exact same temperature.

11:07.480 --> 11:10.040
And no thermodynamic work can ever be done again.

11:10.500 --> 11:11.580
Everything just stops.

11:12.080 --> 11:19.260
Now in human cognition, the text maps this flat gradient to agency collapse or functional brain deadness.

11:19.260 --> 11:21.940
Because there's no gradient for the thoughts to flow down.

11:21.940 --> 11:22.520
Precisely.

11:22.820 --> 11:27.280
Without a scalar gradient, without a concentration of meaning, the cognitive vector flow halts.

11:27.720 --> 11:30.740
You have no directed action, no inference, no ability to make a choice.

11:30.820 --> 11:31.460
And society.

11:31.600 --> 11:35.440
And society, a slack gradient manifests as institutional rigidity.

11:35.900 --> 11:40.140
The societal vorticity decays, the circulation of ideas and resources halts,

11:40.420 --> 11:45.840
and you are left with massive, unmergable, totally rigid bureaucracies that cannot adapt or act.

11:46.120 --> 11:47.560
It's just incredible.

11:47.560 --> 11:51.380
The heat death of the universe, a person losing their cognitive agency,

11:52.080 --> 11:58.140
and a stalled, bloated government bureaucracy are mathematically the exact same phenomena.

11:58.220 --> 11:59.340
Under this framework, yes.

11:59.780 --> 12:02.200
They are all just a flattened RSVP field.

12:02.300 --> 12:04.640
But you know, as I was reading this, I kept hitting a wall.

12:05.040 --> 12:09.220
If reality is just this continuous fluid of scalar and vector fields,

12:09.400 --> 12:11.360
well, fluids can slosh backward.

12:11.360 --> 12:15.120
If it's just pressure and wind, wind can change direction.

12:15.520 --> 12:16.580
