12:16.940 --> 12:19.140
That's the core paradox of thermodynamics.

12:19.460 --> 12:19.660
Right.

12:19.920 --> 12:25.060
If this theory is the substrate of everything, it has to explain why time only flows one way.

12:25.620 --> 12:29.280
